# Telephony and SIP

For Twilio or LiveKit SIP work, always verify the latest official LiveKit telephony documentation through MCP.

Handle: inbound routing, outbound initiation, agent dispatch, caller/agent disconnect, SIP failures, no-answer, busy, timeouts, duplicate webhooks, reconnection, DTMF where required, recording consent where applicable.

Use stable call identifiers for idempotency and traceability.

Do not assume every participant is a browser participant. Distinguish SIP callers, agents, and application participants.
